urity-sensitive code, test coverage, author history.\n\n**Open:**\n- the signals: the paths from step 2's list, configurable in `[cycle]`, or a score from M6's model;\n- where the flag shows: the Review workspace only, or also the spine's step 2 row."}},{"kind":"seen","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1793004401,"data":{"issue":"430e0e2c733f0f764c5637dd2c3bc5b5e85c1410","field":"status","value":"open"}},{"kind":"seen","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1793004401,"data":{"issue":"430e0e2c733f0f764c5637dd2c3bc5b5e85c1410","field":"labels","value":"kind:feat\nstatus:backlog"}}]}